    "long_instructions": "### **Generate with AI**\r\n\r\n#### **Do This:**\r\n\r\n1. **Plan:** In `prompt.md`, write a prompt that will make Button One, when clicked, show this message in the text area:\r\n   \"Button One was clicked!\"\r\n\r\n2. **Build:** Use AI to generate the code.\r\n\r\n3. **Test:** Click Button One and check that it works as expected.\r\n\r\n4. **Check Code:** Look for where the code:\r\n\r\n   * selects the button\r\n   * adds an event listener\r\n   * listens for a click\r\n   * changes the message\r\n\r\n\r\n",
